.DS_Store
**/.build/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
.venv/
*.pyc
results/.tmp-*

# Raw experiment result dumps are regenerable and large (stub CPU runs can
# inflate to many GB when the worker snapshots pools while reading the 11 MB
# tokenizer). Keep them on disk with their run.json/ORIGIN provenance; track
# only source, docs, reports, and manifests. See docs/CONCLUSIONS.md.
/results/
